  "entity_raw": {
    "name_raw": "Subtle Devices",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Heroes of the Streets pg. 29",
    "definition_raw": "Source Heroes of the Streets pg. 29\nYou are skilled at concealing your use of magic items with guile and deft tricks.\n\nPrerequisites: Stealthy.\n\nBenefit: When triggering a wand, staff or any other magic item, you can attempt a Stealth check (opposed by observers’ Perception checks) to conceal the trigger from onlookers. If the magic item produces an obvious effect (such as a summoned creature or visible spell effect), you take a –4 penalty on the Stealth check, and even if your check is successful, observers still see the spell effect (though they fail to notice you are responsible for it).",
